{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Blast is a short arcade roguelike where you control two paddles, bouncing a ball between them to blast geometric shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the shapes to earn points and try to reach the point target each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.poster.avif?t=1768784168\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.webm?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.mp4?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Create Your Build:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy geometric shapes to earn points and unlock powerful upgrades. With over 30 unique upgrades, each run lets you customize your build with different abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.poster.avif?t=1768784168\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.webm?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.mp4?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of the available upgrades include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing the ball size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating a zone that doubles the points of squares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping a laser on the paddle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical projectiles fired by the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Installing a jet on the paddle that makes squares worth more points when hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching multiple balls at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Installing fireballs that spin around the main ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing the points received</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player &amp; Local Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, controlling both paddles yourself, or team up with a friend in local co-op where each player controls one paddle. Work together to blast the shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.poster.avif?t=1768784168\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.webm?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.mp4?t=1768784168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780730?t=1768784168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/b6f09af1908a65cbad58502477cdefcc2cef4355/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768784168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/a123fde9853ea6c7e2616763f1ddafab2278d752/capsule_2